{"t":"Large Crystal Teleporter","s":"large-crystal-teleporter-91520","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Large_Crystal_Teleporter_49a146.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Large Crystal Teleporter</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Large Crystal Teleporter\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Crystal_Teleporter_49a146.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Navigation<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20141116214119&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Crystal_Teleporter_49a146.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a large crystal teleporter.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">GCTS</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, as well as <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hot%20Spot\">Hot Spot</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Truffels%20Garden\">Truffels Garden</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Golem%20Workshop\">Golem Workshop</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Grounds\">Crystal Grounds</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomebase%20Alpha\">Gnomebase Alpha</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzones\">Warzones</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Used to teleport from several cities to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">GCTS</a>. The player must have a <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleport%20Crystal\">Teleport Crystal</a>, which is used up like <a href=\"#/wiki/Orichalcum%20Pearl\">Orichalcum Pearls</a>, in their inventory to teleport. For the warzones, you need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Teleport%20Crystal\">Red Teleport Crystal</a>. Travelling between the other Gnome areas require no crystals at all.<br/><br/>The player must have started the <a href=\"#/quest/bigfoots-burden-quest\">Bigfoot's Burden Quest</a><br/>You will see the message \"You have no idea on how to use this device. Xelvar in Kazordoon might tell you more about it.\" if you try to use it and have not started the quest.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/bigfoots-burden-quest\">Bigfoot's Burden Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomebase%20Alpha\">Gnomebase Alpha</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Crystal%20Teleporter%20%28Berg%29\">Large Crystal Teleporter (Berg)</a></li><li>Navigation</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orichalcum%20Pearl\">Orichalcum Pearl</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Teleport%20Crystal\">Red Teleport Crystal</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleport%20Crystal\">Teleport Crystal</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["bigfoots-burden-quest","tutorial"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"bigfoots-burden-quest","quest":"Bigfoot&#39;s Burden Qu